  "adaptations": [
    "Typed owned runtime classes and particle effects reuse existing checked handles, aggregate dispatch and deferred destruction.",
    "Nonhumanoid TheHand and DeathShroud use body damage without invented head nodes.",
    "Portable RNG, sparse weapon IDs and explicit byte-alpha wrapping are not retail-bit-identical claims.",
    "Static non-box bodies extend the existing triangle-boundary adapter; volumes stay strict.",
    "Two nonfinite editor light positions are retained as invalid metadata; gameplay values remain strict.",
    "Exact authored missing-resource entries remain counted omissions without resource aliases.",
    "Zero-area PolyGrid texture failures remain inspectable; sky portal textures are not loaded because rendering never samples them.",
    "Drudge lightning visuals, missing Priest ambient WAV, chrome and full campaign traversal remain explicit boundaries."
  ]
